{"id":"2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff","date":"2026-11-13","topic":"markets","region":"americas","headline":"Nvidia Leader Reminded Staff They Were Almost Broke","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jensen_Huang"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Jensen Huang started the computer company Nvidia.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.3,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.39,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.84,1.42,1.64,2.0,2.44]},{"text":"In 1996, the company had very little money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t1-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":3.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.96,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.0,1.54,1.86,2.14,2.5,2.9]},{"text":"For years, Huang opened every meeting with a warning.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t1-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.24,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.78,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.88,1.04,1.46,1.88,2.38,2.64,2.74]},{"text":"He told workers the company was close to closing.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","S","S","V","C","C","C"],"dur":2.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.22,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.22,0.6,0.94,1.24,1.52,1.84,2.2]},{"text":"He said this even after Nvidia became very rich.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","S","V","C","C"],"dur":3.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.07,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.26,0.44,0.82,1.38,1.64,2.26,2.68]}],"bands":{"core1000":92,"core1800":5,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"In 1996,","title":"Prepositional Phrase of Time","note":"This prepositional phrase acts as a modifier telling us when the main action occurred. Placing it at the beginning of the sentence sets the timeframe before presenting the main point."},{"i":4,"focus":"even after Nvidia became very rich","title":"Time Clause with Subordinating Conjunction","note":"The conjunction 'even after' connects a subordinate time clause to the main sentence. It shows that an action continued despite a big change in circumstances."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Jensen Huang helped start the technology company Nvidia in 1993.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":5.06,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.63,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.78,1.24,1.64,1.88,2.26,2.78,3.36,3.96]},{"text":"Their first computer chip failed, so the business lost money.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","M","S","S","V","O"],"dur":3.24,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.63,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.68,1.04,1.9,2.02,2.22,2.42,2.76]},{"text":"The company shrank to about 35 people to survive in 1996.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.46,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.2,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.28,0.72,0.94,1.1,1.54,2.22,2.44,2.74,3.26]},{"text":"For many years, Huang began every meeting with a short sentence.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t2-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.35,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,1.04,1.18,1.64,2.0,2.48,2.74,2.82,3.06]},{"text":"He told his team that Nvidia was thirty days from closing.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","V","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.53,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.48,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.2,0.42,0.64,0.98,1.32,1.86,2.24,2.62,2.94]},{"text":"He kept saying this quote because he wanted them to work hard.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","C","C","C"],"dur":3.6,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.85,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.14,0.42,0.64,0.9,1.4,1.54,1.8,2.06,2.24,2.54]}],"bands":{"core1000":88,"core1800":5,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"so","title":"Coordinating Conjunction for Cause-Effect","note":"The coordinating conjunction 'so' links two independent clauses to indicate cause and effect. It explains that the financial loss was a direct result of the chip failing."},{"i":5,"focus":"kept saying","title":"Keep + Gerund for Repeated Actions","note":"The verb 'keep' followed by a gerund (-ing form) expresses an action repeated over a period of time. Here it highlights Huang's continuous habit of repeating the warning."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Jensen Huang, who co-founded Nvidia, often reminded his employees about early struggles.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":6.06,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.22,"times":[0.0,0.34,1.18,1.36,1.84,2.86,3.08,3.46,3.84,4.18,4.8,5.12]},{"text":"After its first computer chip failed, the business almost went bankrupt in 1996.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","M","V","C","M","M"],"dur":5.46,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.01,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.34,0.56,0.9,1.4,2.26,2.36,2.62,3.08,3.42,3.9,4.18]},{"text":"The company shrank to about 35 workers who tried hard to survive.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M"],"dur":4.4,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.32,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.32,0.76,0.94,1.14,1.66,2.36,2.7,2.92,3.38,3.66]},{"text":"For many years, Huang opened company meetings with a famous sentence.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.05,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":4.39,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.26,1.04,1.26,1.7,2.1,2.48,2.78,2.88,3.22]},{"text":"He told the team that Nvidia was thirty days from going out of business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":4.44,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.2,0.4,0.64,0.86,1.1,1.68,2.06,2.48,2.8,3.0,3.2,3.3]},{"text":"He has kept using this phrase even after Nvidia became extremely successful.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","M","M","S","V","C","C"],"dur":4.44,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":4.65,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.12,0.3,0.64,0.92,1.2,1.66,2.14,2.44,2.92,3.48]},{"text":"Huang wants his staff to stay alert and never feel completely comfortable.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.69,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":6.11,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.42,0.58,0.84,1.06,1.32,1.72,2.18,2.48,2.88,3.36]}],"bands":{"core1000":80,"core1800":10,"ngsl":2,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":6},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":", who co-founded Nvidia,","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"This relative clause provides extra background information about the subject. Because it is non-essential details enclosed in commas, the core sentence remains clear without it."},{"i":5,"focus":"has kept using","title":"Present Perfect Aspect with Gerund","note":"The present perfect form combined with a gerund indicates an action that started in the past and continues into the present. It emphasizes unbroken repetition up to the current moment."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Jensen Huang, the chief executive of Nvidia, frequently shared a stark warning with his corporate team.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.67,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":8.25,"times":[0.0,0.38,1.38,1.5,1.68,2.16,2.5,3.52,3.88,4.32,4.6,4.92,5.4,5.78,5.9,6.2]},{"text":"When the technology firm launched its first microchip, the product failed to perform as expected.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.48,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.2,0.6,0.98,1.32,1.64,1.94,2.98,3.24,3.56,3.98,4.26,4.58,4.9]},{"text":"Consequently, Nvidia was forced to shrink to approximately 35 employees in 1996 to remain operational.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":7.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":9.72,"times":[0.0,1.3,1.3,1.58,1.82,2.1,2.42,2.7,3.02,4.06,4.76,5.14,5.7,6.46,6.68]},{"text":"Following that crisis, Huang established a routine of starting every staff gathering with the same phrase.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":6.44,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.44,1.52,1.54,2.22,2.36,2.6,3.04,3.38,3.9,4.32,4.64,5.12,5.26,5.6]},{"text":"He repeatedly informed employees that the company was only thirty days from going out of business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","M","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":5.95,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.44,0.86,1.58,1.84,1.96,2.2,2.46,2.8,3.22,3.58,3.92,4.12,4.34,4.42]},{"text":"This persistent statement was maintained even after Nvidia evolved into one of the world's most valuable corporations.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.78,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.3,0.98,1.26,1.58,2.26,2.74,3.14,3.54,3.94,4.2,4.3,4.4,4.84,5.02,5.58]},{"text":"Huang explained that he wanted his workforce to maintain a permanent sense of urgency.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":4.88,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.5,0.78,0.92,1.16,1.44,1.64,2.08,2.3,2.74,3.14,3.6,3.86]},{"text":"By reminding staff of past hardship, he ensured that complacency would never settle into the business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","S","V","V","V","M","M","M"],"dur":6.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":6.79,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.42,0.78,1.02,1.2,2.34,2.42,2.74,2.96,3.76,4.0,4.28,4.7,5.02,5.12]}],"bands":{"core1000":72,"core1800":12,"ngsl":5,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"was forced to shrink","title":"Passive Voice with Infinitive Complement","note":"The passive structure 'was forced' shows that external circumstances compelled Nvidia to act. The infinitive 'to shrink' completes the predicate by stating the required action."},{"i":7,"focus":"By reminding staff of past hardship","title":"Preposition + Gerund for Means","note":"The preposition 'by' followed by a gerund indicates the method or means by which something is accomplished. It explains how Huang achieved the result stated in the main clause."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Even as Nvidia transformed into a global technology powerhouse, chief executive Jensen Huang kept a surprisingly grim tradition alive.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","C"],"dur":9.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":11.43,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.68,1.04,1.64,2.38,2.5,2.82,3.24,4.8,5.16,5.78,6.08,6.58,7.08,7.3,7.8,8.38,8.86]},{"text":"For decades, Huang routinely opened internal corporate meetings by telling employees that the company was thirty days from going out of business.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.58,"times":[0.0,0.06,1.0,1.16,1.62,2.24,2.72,3.1,3.54,4.1,4.38,4.98,5.24,5.32,5.7,6.02,6.42,6.86,7.2,7.4,7.64,7.72]},{"text":"This unusual habit was rooted in the firm's early struggles after its initial semiconductor chip failed to find commercial success.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.71,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":8.89,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.34,1.16,1.44,1.72,2.02,2.1,2.48,2.72,3.28,3.96,4.22,4.48,5.22,5.6,6.04,6.26,6.5,6.74]},{"text":"To survive that near-fatal setback in 1996, Nvidia was forced to reduce its headcount to roughly 35 people.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":7.75,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":9.6,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.68,1.44,1.82,2.22,3.7,3.92,4.28,4.5,4.76,5.06,5.32,5.76,6.1,6.28,6.86]},{"text":"That harrowing experience convinced Huang that corporate security was an illusion capable of dulling a technology company's competitive edge.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":8.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":10.35,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.66,1.46,2.14,2.52,2.86,3.14,3.7,4.16,4.3,4.6,5.42,5.78,6.26,6.38,6.6,7.4,7.68]},{"text":"Rather than abandoning the warning once Nvidia achieved unprecedented market capitalization, Huang chose to repeat it endlessly to his growing workforce.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.75,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":11.48,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.48,0.7,1.18,1.46,1.78,2.1,2.66,3.44,3.84,5.26,5.48,5.9,6.1,6.36,6.56,7.0,7.52,7.64,7.86]},{"text":"He believed that reminding staff of near-extinction would foster a culture of perpetual alertness and continuous discipline.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":8.63,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.38,0.58,0.9,1.44,1.63,2.62,3.16,3.38,3.72,4.0,4.24,4.46,5.54,5.96,6.52]},{"text":"Today, the legendary opening line remains a cornerstone of Nvidia's corporate culture, serving as a reminder that success is never permanent.","voice":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-13-markets-nvidia-leader-reminded-staff/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":11.35,"times":[0.0,0.6,0.76,1.12,1.68,2.1,2.5,2.78,3.16,3.76,4.22,4.42,5.44,5.7,5.96,6.08,6.38,6.86,7.16,7.66,8.1]}],"bands":{"core1000":63,"core1800":14,"ngsl":8,"tsl":3,"nawl":1,"beyond":11},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"kept a surprisingly grim tradition alive","title":"Complex Transitive Pattern (SVOC)","note":"This sentence uses a complex transitive structure (S+V+O+C) where 'alive' acts as an object complement modifying 'tradition'. It describes the state in which Huang maintained the tradition."},{"i":5,"focus":"Rather than abandoning the warning","title":"Prepositional Contrast with Gerund","note":"The prepositional phrase 'rather than' followed by a gerund expresses contrast or choice between two alternatives. It indicates what option was rejected in favor of the main action."},{"i":7,"focus":"serving as a reminder that success is never permanent","title":"Participial Phrase as Sentence Modifier","note":"This participial phrase acts as an adverbial modifier describing the ongoing function or effect of the main clause. It add